<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasDocumentaryFormTypeOfAllMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was documentary form type of all members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Documentary Form Type and a Record Set whose all past
         or present Record or Record Part members have that Documentary Form Type."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasDocumentaryFormTypeOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was documentary form type of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Documentary Form Type and a Record Set whose some past
