<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasExpressedBy> rdfs:label "is or was expressed by"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Rule to a Record Resource that expresses or expressed
         the Rule."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasHolderOf> rdfs:label "is or was holder of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Agent to a Record Resource or Instantiation that the
