<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasHolderOfIntellectualPropertyRightsOf> rdfs:label "is or was holder of intellectual property rights of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Agent to a Record Resource or Instantiation on which
         the Agent has or had some intellectual property rights."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasIdentifierOf> rdfs:label "is or was identifier of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Identifier to a Thing that it identified or
         identifies."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasIncludedIn> rdfs:label "is or was included in"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'includes or included' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasInstantiationOf> rdfs:label "is or was instantiation of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had instantiation' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasJurisdictionOf> rdfs:label "is or was jurisdiction of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place to an Agent that has or had jurisdiction over the
         Place."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLanguageOf> rdfs:label "is or was language of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Language to an Agent, Record or Record Part that uses
         or used it."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLanguageOfAllMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was language of all members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Language and a Record Set whose all present or past
         Record or Record Part members use that Language."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLanguageOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was language of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Language and a Record Set whose some present or past
         Record or Record Part members use that Language."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLeaderOf> rdfs:label "is or was leader of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Person to the Group that Person leads or led in the
         past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLegalStatusOf> rdfs:label "is or was legal status of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Legal Status to an Agent or Record Resource that it
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLegalStatusOfAllMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was legal status of all members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Legal Status and a Record Set whose all past or present
         Record or Record Part members have that Legal Status."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLegalStatusOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was legal status of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Legal Status and a Record Set whose some past or
         present Record or Record Part members have that Legal Status."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLocationOf> rdfs:label "is or was location of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place to a Thing that is or was located in the
