<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasLocationOfAgent> rdfs:label "is or was location of agent"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place to an Agent that is or was located in this
         Place."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasMainSubjectOf> rdfs:label "is or was main subject of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had main subject' object
