<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasMainSubjectOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was main subject of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had some members with main subject' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasMainThingRepresentedByContentOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label """is or was main thing represented by content of some members
         of"""@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had some members whose content mainly
         represents' object property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasManagerOf> rdfs:label "is or was manager of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Agent to a Record Resource or Instantiation that the
         Agent managed or manages."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasMandateTypeOf> rdfs:label "is or was mandate type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Mandate Type to a Mandate that it categorized or
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasMemberOf> rdfs:label "is or was member of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has or had member' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasNameOf> rdfs:label "is or was name of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Name to a Thing that it designated or
         designates."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasOccupationTypeOf> rdfs:label "is or was occupation type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Occupation Type to a Person whose occupation is or was
         categorized by it."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasOccupiedBy> rdfs:label "is or was occupied by"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'occupies or occupied' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasOwnerOf> rdfs:label "is or was owner of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Group, Person or Position to a Thing that this Agent
         owns or owned."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPartOf> rdfs:label "is or was part of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has or had part' relation."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasParticipantIn> rdfs:label "is or was participant in"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had participant' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPerformedBy> rdfs:label "is or was performed by"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Activity to an Agent that performed or performs the
         Activity."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPhysicalLocationOf> rdfs:label "is or was physical location of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Physical Location to a Place, when it is or was its
         location."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPlaceNameOf> rdfs:label "is or was place name of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place Name to a Place that was or is designated by
         it."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPlaceTypeOf> rdfs:label "is or was place type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place Type to a Place that is or was categorized by
         it."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasRecordStateOfAllMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was record state of all members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record State and a Record Set whose all past or present
         Record or Record Part members have that Record State."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasRecordStateOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was record state of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record State and a Record Set whose some past or
         present Record or Record Part members have that Record State."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasRegulatedBy> rdfs:label "is or was regulated by"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'regulates or regulated' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasRepresentedByContentOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was represented by content of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had some members whose content represents'
         object property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasResponsibleForEnforcing> rdfs:label "is or was responsible for enforcing"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'is or was enforced by' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasRuleTypeOf> rdfs:label "is or was rule type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Rule Type to a Rule that it categorized or
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasSubdivisionOf> rdfs:label "is or was subdivision of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had subdivision' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasSubeventOf> rdfs:label "is or was subevent of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has or had subevent' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasSubjectOf> rdfs:label "is or was subject of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has or had subject' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasSubjectOfAllMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was subject of all members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had all members with subject' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasSubjectOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was subject of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had some members with subject' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasSubordinateTo> rdfs:label "is or was subordinate to"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had subordinate' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasTitleOf> rdfs:label "is or was title of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Title to a Record Resource, Instantiation or Rule that
         it designated or designates."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasTypeOf> rdfs:label "is or was type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Type to a Thing that it categorizes or
         categorized."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasTypeOfAllMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was type of all members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Type and a Record Set whose all present or past Record
         or Record Part members belong to that Type."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasTypeOfSomeMembersOf> rdfs:label "is or was type of some members of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Type and a Record Set whose some present or past Record
         or Record Part members belong to that Type."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasUnderAuthorityOf> rdfs:label "is or was under authority of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has or had authority over' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrganicOrFunctionalProvenanceOf> rdfs:label "is organic or functional provenance of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has organic or functional provenance' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrganicProvenanceDateOf> rdfs:label "is organic provenance date of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Date associated with the organic provenance of a Record
         Resource or Instantiation to that Record Resource or Instantiation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrganicProvenanceOf> rdfs:label "is organic provenance of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has organic provenance' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOriginalOf> rdfs:label "is original of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects the original version of a Record to a copy or a later
         version."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isPartOfTransitive> rdfs:label "is part of transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to a Thing of which it is a a constitutive or
         component part, directly or indirectly. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isPlaceAssociatedWith> rdfs:label "is place associated with"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place to a Thing with whose existence and lifecycle the
         Place is associated."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isPlaceAssociatedWithAgent> rdfs:label "is place associated with agent"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place to an Agent which is related to that
         Place."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isProductionTechniqueTypeOf> rdfs:label "is production technique type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Production Technique Type to an Instantiation whose
         production technique is categorized by it."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isPublicationDateOf> rdfs:label "is publication date of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Date to a Record Resource that was or will be made
         public at this Date."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isPublisherOf> rdfs:label "is publisher of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Agent to a Record Resource that it
         published."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isReceiverOf> rdfs:label "is receiver of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'received by' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRecordResourceAssociatedWithRecordResource> rdfs:label "is record resource associated with record resource"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects two Record Resources. This relation is
         symmetric."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRecordSetTypeOf> rdfs:label "is record set type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record Set Type to a Record Set that it
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRecordStateOf> rdfs:label "is record state of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record State to a Record or Record Part whose state it
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRelatedTo> rdfs:label "is related to"@en ;
    schema:description """The most generic relation, is related to, connects any Thing to
         any other Thing. This relation is symmetric."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isReplyTo> rdfs:label "is reply to"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has reply' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRepresentationTypeOf> rdfs:label "is representation type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Representation Type to an Instantiation that it
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRepresentedByContentOf> rdfs:label "is represented by content of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has content which represents' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isResponsibleForIssuing> rdfs:label "is responsible for issuing"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'issued by' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isRuleAssociatedWith> rdfs:label "is rule associated with"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Rule to a Thing that is associated with the
         Rule."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isSenderOf> rdfs:label "is sender of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has sender' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isSourceOfInformationOfRecordResource> rdfs:label "is source of information of Record Resource"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record Resource to a Record Resource, when the first is
         used as a source of information for producing the content of the second one."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isSubdivisionOfTransitive> rdfs:label "is subdivision of transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Group to the Group it is a direct or indirect
         subdivision of. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isSubeventOfTransitive> rdfs:label "is subevent of transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an ongoing Event to an Event of which it is a direct or
         indirect part. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isSubordinateToTransitive> rdfs:label "is subordinate to transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Agent to an Agent that is directly or indirectly
         hierarchically superior. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isSuccessorOf> rdfs:label "is successor of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'has successor' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isTitleTypeOf> rdfs:label "is title type of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Title Type and a Title that it
         categorizes."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isToUseDateOf> rdfs:label "is to use date of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Date to an Appellation, when it is the date till which
         the Appellation was used."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isUnitOfMeasurementOf> rdfs:label "is unit of measurement of"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'has unit of measurement' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isWithin> rdfs:label "is within"@en ;
    schema:description "Connects a Date to a Date in which it is contained."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#issuedBy> rdfs:label "issued by"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Rule to the Agent that issued or published the
         Rule."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#knownBy> rdfs:label "known by"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'knows of' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#knows> rdfs:label "knows"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects two Persons that directly know each other during their
         existence. This relation is symmetric."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#knowsOf> rdfs:label "knows of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Person to another Person they have some knowledge of
         through time or space."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#lastModificationDate> rdfs:label "last modification date"@en ;
    schema:description "Date at which an entity was last updated."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#latitude> rdfs:label "latitude"@en ;
    schema:description "Distance in degrees north or south of the equator."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#length> rdfs:label "length"@en ;
    schema:description "Length of an entity."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#location> rdfs:label "location"@en ;
    schema:description """A delimitation of the physical territory of a Place. Used to
         describe basic human-readable text such as an address, a cadastral reference, or less
         precise information found in a Record."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#longitude> rdfs:label "longitude"@en ;
    schema:description """Distance in degrees east or west of a prime
         meridian."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#measure> rdfs:label "measure"@en ;
    schema:description """The extent, quantity, amount, or degree of an entity, as
         determined by measurement or calculation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#migratedFrom> rdfs:label "migrated from"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'migrated into' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#migratedInto> rdfs:label "migrated into"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Instantiation to a version it has been migrated
         into."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#migrationDate> rdfs:label "migration date"@en ;
    schema:description """Date at which an Instantiation was or will be
         migrated."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#modificationDate> rdfs:label "modification date"@en ;
    schema:description "Date of the modification of an entity."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#mostMembersWithAccumulationDate> rdfs:label "most members with accumulation date"@en ;
    schema:description """Date at which most of the present or past members of a Record Set
         were or will be accumulated."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#mostMembersWithCreationDate> rdfs:label "most members with creation date"@en ;
    schema:description """Date at which most of the present or past members of a Record Set
         were or will be created."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#name> rdfs:label "name"@en ;
    schema:description """A label, title or term designating an entity in order to make it
         distinguishable from other similar entities."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#normalizedDateValue> rdfs:label "normalized date value"@en ;
    schema:description """Machine readable representation of the date based on a public
         technical standard."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#normalizedValue> rdfs:label "normalized value"@en ;
    schema:description """Value representation based on a standard, preferably
         machine-readable."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#note> rdfs:label "note"@en ;
    schema:description """A short textual statement, that gives a little information on a
         specific feature of a Thing."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#occupiesOrOccupied> rdfs:label "occupies or occupied"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Person to a Position they occupy or
         occupied."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#occurredAtDate> rdfs:label "occurred at date"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'is date of occurrence of' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#overlapsOrOverlapped> rdfs:label "overlaps or overlapped"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects two Places that geographically overlap or overlapped.
         This relation is symmetric."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#performsOrPerformed> rdfs:label "performs or performed"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'is or was performed by' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#physicalCharacteristicsNote> rdfs:label "physical characteristics note"@en ;
    schema:description """Information about the physical features, completeness, or
         conservation status of an Instantiation. Includes information about the physical nature and
         condition such as conservation status or the deterioration of an Instantiation (for example
         its carrier) affecting the ability to recover information. """@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#physicalOrLogicalExtent> rdfs:label "physical or logical extent"@en ;
    schema:description """Countable characteristics of the content of an entity expressed as
         a quantity."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#precededInSequence> rdfs:label "preceded in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to a Thing that followed it in some sequence (not
         necessarily defined or characterised chronologically) in the past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#precedesInSequenceTransitive> rdfs:label "precedes in sequence transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to a Thing that follows it directly or indirectly
         in some sequence (not necessarily defined or characterised chronologically). This is a
         transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#precedesInTime> rdfs:label "precedes in time"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to a Thing that follows it in chronological
         order. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#precedesOrPreceded> rdfs:label "precedes or preceded"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to a Thing that follows or followed it in some
         sequence."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#precedesProxyInSequence> rdfs:label "precedes proxy in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record Resource to a Proxy of a Record Resource that it
         precedes directly or indirectly in some sequence (not necessarily defined or characterised
         chronologically)."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#productionTechnique> rdfs:label "production technique"@en ;
    schema:description """The method used in the representation of information on an
         Instantiation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyDirectlyFollowsInSequence> rdfs:label "proxy directly follows in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'directly precedes proxy in sequence' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyDirectlyFollowsProxyInSequence> rdfs:label "proxy directly follows proxy in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'proxy directly precedes proxy in sequence' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyDirectlyIncludes> rdfs:label "proxy directly includes"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'is directly included in proxy' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyDirectlyIncludesProxy> rdfs:label "proxy directly includes proxy"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'proxy is directly included in' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyDirectlyPrecedesInSequence> rdfs:label "proxy directly precedes in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record Resource to a Record Resource which
         it precedes directly in some sequence (not necessarily defined or characterised
         chronologically)."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyDirectlyPrecedesProxyInSequence> rdfs:label "proxy directly precedes proxy in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record Resource to a Proxy of another Record
         Resource that it precedes directly in some sequence (not necessarily defined or
         characterised chronologically)."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyFollowsInSequence> rdfs:label "proxy follows in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'precedes proxy in sequence' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyFollowsProxyInSequenceTransitive> rdfs:label "proxy follows proxy in sequence transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'proxy recedes proxy in sequence transitive' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyFor> rdfs:label "proxy for"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy to the Record Resource it stands for in the
         context of a specific Record Resource."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyHasConstituent> rdfs:label "proxy has constituent"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'is constituent of proxy' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyHasConstituentProxyTransitive> rdfs:label "proxy has constituent proxy transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'proxy is constituent of proxy transitive' object
         property. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyHasDirectConstituent> rdfs:label "proxy has direct constituent"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'is direct constituent of proxy' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyHasDirectConstituentProxy> rdfs:label "proxy has direct constituent proxy"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'proxy is direct constituent of' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIn> rdfs:label "proxy in"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy to the Record Resource in which it stands for
         (represents) another Record Resource."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyInRecord> rdfs:label "proxy in record"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy to a Record in which it stands for (represents) a
         Record Part or another Record."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyInRecordSet> rdfs:label "proxy in record set"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy to a Record Set in which it stands for
         (represents) a Record or another Record Set."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIncludes> rdfs:label "proxy includes"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'is included in proxy' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIncludesProxyTransitive> rdfs:label "proxy includes proxy transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'proxy is included in proxy transitive' object
         property. This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsConstituentOf> rdfs:label "proxy is constituent of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Part to a Record or Record
         Part which it is a constituent of, directly or indirectly."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsConstituentOfProxyTransitive> rdfs:label "proxy is constituent of proxy transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Part to a Proxy of another
         Record or Record Part which it is a constituent of, directly or indirectly. This is a
         transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsDirectConstituentOf> rdfs:label "proxy is direct constituent of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Part to another Record or
         Record Part which the first is a direct constituent of."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsDirectConstituentOfProxy> rdfs:label "proxy is direct constituent of proxy"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Part to a Proxy of another
         Record or Record Part of which the first is a direct constituent."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsDirectlyIncludedIn> rdfs:label "proxy is directly included in"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Set to another Record Set
         which the first is directly included in."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsDirectlyIncludedInProxy> rdfs:label "proxy is directly included in proxy"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Set to a Proxy of a Record
         Set which it is directly included in."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsIncludedIn> rdfs:label "proxy is included in"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Set to a Record Set which
         it is included in, directly or indirectly."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyIsIncludedInProxyTransitive> rdfs:label "proxy is included in proxy transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record or Record Set to a Proxy of a Record
         Set which it is included in, directly or indirectly. This is a transitive
         relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyPrecedesInSequence> rdfs:label "proxy precedes in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record Resource to a Record Resource which
         the first precedes directly or indirectly in some sequence (not necessarily defined or
         characterised chronologically)."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#proxyPrecedesProxyInSequenceTransitive> rdfs:label "proxy precedes proxy in sequence transitive"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Proxy of a Record Resource to a Proxy of another Record
         Resource which directly or indirectly follows the first in some sequence (not necessarily
         defined or characterised chronologically). This is a transitive relation."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#publicationDate> rdfs:label "publication date"@en ;
    schema:description """Date of the publication, in the past or in the future, of a Record
         Resource."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#qualityOfRepresentationNote> rdfs:label "quality of representation note"@en ;
    schema:description """Characteristics of an Instantiation that affect the ability to
         recover the intellectual content. Such characteristics may be related to the methods used
         in creating the Instantiation or introduced subsequent to the creation through
         accident."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#quantity> rdfs:label "quantity"@en ;
    schema:description "Machine-readable quantity."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#rankInHierarchy> rdfs:label "rank in hierarchy"@en ;
    schema:description """The rank of a Record Resource, or of a Proxy that stands for it,
         in a hierarchy."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#rankInSequence> rdfs:label "rank in sequence"@en ;
    schema:description """The rank of a Record Resource, or of a Proxy that stands for it,
         in a sequence."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#recordResourceExtent> rdfs:label "Record Resource Extent"@en ;
    schema:description """The quantity of information content, as human experienced,
         contained in a Record Resource. The method and precision of expressing the quantity of
         information represented in a Record Resource will vary according to the kind of Record
         Resource being described, processing economy constraints, etc. For record sets, quantity
         may be expressed as number of records, or, for analogue records in particular, by the
         physical storage dimensions of the members of the Record Set. For individual records or
         record parts, quantity may be expressed in more precise terms. """@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#recordResourceHasSourceOfInformation> rdfs:label "Record Resource has source of information"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record Resource to a Record Resource, when the second
         one is used as a source of information for producing the content of the first
         one."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#recordResourceSourceOfInformation> rdfs:label "Record Resource source of information"@en ;
    schema:description """Information about some source on which the content of a Record
         Resource is based."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#recordResourceStructure> rdfs:label "Record Resource structure"@en ;
    schema:description """Information about the intellectual arrangement and composition of
         a Record Resource. For Record and Record Part, it encompasses information about the
         intellectual composition of the record, the presence of record parts and their functions.
         For Record Set, it encompasses information about the methodology or criteria used for
         arranging the Record Set members or Record members within the containing Record
         Set"""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#referenceSystem> rdfs:label "reference system"@en ;
    schema:description """Framework or standard used to represent an
         information."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#regulatesOrRegulated> rdfs:label "regulates or regulated"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Rule to a Thing that it regulates or
         regulated."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#resultedFromTheMergerOf> rdfs:label "resulted from the merger of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'was merged into' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#resultedFromTheSplitOf> rdfs:label "resulted from the split of"@en ;
    schema:description "Inverse of 'was split into' object property."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#resultsOrResultedFrom> rdfs:label "results or resulted from"@en ;
    schema:description """Inverse of 'results or resulted in' object
         property."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#resultsOrResultedIn> rdfs:label "results or resulted in"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Event to a Thing that results or resulted from the
         Event."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#ruleFollowed> rdfs:label "rule followed"@en ;
    schema:description """The rule or conditions that govern the existence or lifecycle of a
         Thing."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#scopeAndContent> rdfs:label "scope and content"@en ;
    schema:description """Summary of the scope (such as time periods, geography) and content
         (such as subject matter, administrative processes) of a Record Resource. Provides a more
         complete summary of the informational content of the Record Resource highlighting the
         information conveyed in the Record Resource, why it was created, received, and/or
         maintained, and the agents connected to it. It may include description of relations with
         agents, activities, dates and places, or with other record resources."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#sentimentOrEmotionExpressed> rdfs:label "sentiment or emotion expressed"@en ;
    schema:description """Specification of, or information about, the sentiment(s) or
         emotion(s) expressed by the content of a Record or a Record Part."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#someMembersWithAccumulationDate> rdfs:label "some members with accumulation date"@en ;
    schema:description """Date at which some of the present or past members of a Record Set
         were or will be accumulated."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#someMembersWithCreationDate> rdfs:label "some members with creation date"@en ;
    schema:description """Date at which some of the present or past members of a Record Set
         were or will be created."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#structure> rdfs:label "structure"@en ;
    schema:description """Information about the intellectual arrangement and composition of
         a Record Resource or the physical arrangement and composition of an Instantiation. For
         Record and Record Part, it encompasses information about the intellectual composition of
         the record, the presence of record parts and their functions. For Record Set, it
         encompasses information about the methodology or criteria used for arranging the Record Set
         members or Record members within the containing Record Set. For Instantiation, it may
         comprise information about the composition of the physical elements of the
         instantiation"""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#studiesOrStudiedAt> rdfs:label "studies or studied at"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Person to an educational institution at which they
         studied or study. Both 'institution' and 'at' can be interpreted broadly."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#technicalCharacteristics> rdfs:label "technical characteristics"@en ;
    schema:description """Describes any relevant physical or software feature of any device
         involved in the creation or management of a Record Resource."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#textualValue> rdfs:label "textual value"@en ;
    schema:description "A textual expression of an Appellation or Date."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#title> rdfs:label "title"@en ;
    schema:description """An identifying name of a Record Resource, Instantiation or
         Rule."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#type> rdfs:label "type"@en ;
    schema:description "A term used to characterize an entity."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#unitOfMeasurement> rdfs:label "unit of measurement"@en ;
    schema:description """A definite magnitude of a quantity, defined and adopted by
         convention or by law, that is used as a standard for measurement of the same kind of
         quantity. Can be spacial units (cm, m), weight (g, kg), time (s, h), storage (MB, TB) or
         more informal units used in the archival context like number of boxes, pages or
         words."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#usedFromDate> rdfs:label "used from date"@en ;
    schema:description "Date at which an Appellation was first used."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#usedToDate> rdfs:label "used to date"@en ;
    schema:description "Date until an Appellation was used."@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasComponentOf> rdfs:label "was component of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Instantiation to another Instantiation of which it was
         a component in the past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasConstituentOf> rdfs:label "was constituent of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record or Record Part to another Record or Record Part
         of which it was a constituent in the past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasContainedBy> rdfs:label "was contained by"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Place to a Place within which it was
         contained."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasIncludedIn> rdfs:label "was included in"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Record to a Record or Record Set in which it was
         included in the past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasLastUpdatedAtDate> rdfs:label "was last updated at date"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to the Date when it was last
         modified."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasMergedInto> rdfs:label "was merged into"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Corporate Body to another Corporate Body that is the
         result of a merger of the previous one with one to many other corporate
         bodies."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasPartOf> rdfs:label "was part of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Thing to a Thing of which it was a constitutive or
         component part in the past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasSplitInto> rdfs:label "was split into"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a Corporate Body to one of the Corporate Bodies that
         results from the split of the previous one into two to many corporate
         bodies."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasSubdivisionOf> rdfs:label "was subdivision of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a subdivision to the Group it was a part of in the
         past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasSubeventOf> rdfs:label "was subevent of"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects a past Event to the broader Event of which it was a
         part."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasSubordinateTo> rdfs:label "was subordinate to"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Agent to an Agent that was hierarchically superior in
         the past."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasUsedFromDate> rdfs:label "was used from date"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Appellation to the Date from which it was
         used."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#wasUsedToDate> rdfs:label "was used to date"@en ;
    schema:description """Connects an Appellation to the Date till when it was
         used."""@en .

<https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#width> rdfs:label "width"@en ;
    schema:description "Horizontal dimension of an entity."@en .

